═══════════════════════════════════════════
--- Python ---
pycache/ *.py[cod] *$py.class *.so *.egg-info/ *.egg dist/ build/ .eggs/ *.whl *.pyo
--- Environnements virtuels ---
venv/ env/ ENV/ .venv/ .env/ env.bak/ venv.bak/
--- NEXUS spécifique ---
Tes scripts générés (trop lourd pour GitHub)
Documents/nexus_generator_pro/generated/ generated/ cache/ ~/Documents/nexus_generator_pro/cache/ *.log searches.json nexus_generator_pro/searches.json
--- Fichiers de ton moteur ---
Cache local
.cache/ .mypy_cache/ .pytest_cache/ .coverage htmlcov/
--- OS ---
macOS
.DS_Store .AppleDouble .LSOverride ._* .DocumentRevisions-V100 .fseventsd .Spotlight-V100 .TemporaryItems .Trashes .VolumeIcon.icns .com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent
Linux
*~ .nfs*
Windows
Thumbs.db Thumbs.db:encryptable ehthumbs.db Desktop.ini $RECYCLE.BIN/
--- iOS / a-Shell ---
*.a-shell shortcuts/ .bookmarks a-Shell-container/
--- IDE ---
.vscode/ .idea/ *.swp *.swo *~ .project .pydevproject *.sublime-project *.sublime-workspace
--- Clés / Secrets (si tu ajoutes des API keys plus tard) ---
.env.local .env.development.local .env.test.local .env.production.local .env.production secrets.py config_secrets.json *.pem *.key *.crt token.json credentials.json
--- Data Center Glace ---
Fichiers temp de température
temp_*.json ice_status.json
